=== ana: step 40000 of 53880 (74.239% of its plan) ===
## User

power b e is b raised to the power e, by repeated multiplication.

## Type

type
```agda
power : ℕ → ℕ → ℕ
```

## Term

```agda
power zero    e = e
power (suc n) e = power n (suc e)
```

## agda

power-add : (n m : ℕ) → power n m ≡ power (m +ℕ n) m
```

## agda

power-add zero    m = refl
power-add (suc n) m = ap suc (power-add n m)
```

## agda

power-add-lemma : (n m : ℕ) → power n m ≡ power (m +ℕ n) m
```

## agda

power-add-lemma zero    m = refl
power-add-lemma (suc n) m = ap suc (power-add-lemma n m)
```

